# F8 / TAU-SUPPLY-1 — keep Cargo.lock for the Tauri client (binary).
# Locking the resolved tree pins every transitive supply-chain dep so
# a hostile crates.io publish can't sneak in via the next CI build.
!client/src-tauri/Cargo.lock

